{"id":"6c973042c939008f","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-cardinal-saturation.md","title":"κ-Saturated","display":"df-cardinal-saturation — κ-Saturated","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-cardinal-saturation","aliases":["17-df-cardinal-saturation"],"display":"df-cardinal-saturation — κ-Saturated","depends_on":["[[17-df-reduct]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-type]]","[[17-df-type-realization]]","[[17-df-language-constants]]","[[17-df-diagram]]","[[17-df-elementary-diagram]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]"],"source_section":"5.1","source_result":"Cardinal-index saturation definition; Proposition 5.1.2(ii)","source_pages_print":[292,293],"source_pages_djvu":[308,309],"source_verification":"definition and finite-model argument compared in supplied OCR; finite cardinal indices restored","label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-5.1.1","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-cardinal-saturation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-cardinal-saturation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cardinal-saturation — κ-Saturated"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f48c896e5c0651df\" href=\"?note=f48c896e5c0651df\" title=\"17-df-reduct\">17-df-reduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a41374cf828233e6\" href=\"?note=a41374cf828233e6\" title=\"17-df-type-realization\">17-df-type-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5772a390b9182440\" href=\"?note=5772a390b9182440\" title=\"17-df-language-constants\">17-df-language-constants</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"45c3869fde7fe37f\" href=\"?note=45c3869fde7fe37f\" title=\"17-df-diagram\">17-df-diagram</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b664bed1223db216\" href=\"?note=b664bed1223db216\" title=\"17-df-elementary-diagram\">17-df-elementary-diagram</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"5.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Cardinal-index saturation definition; Proposition 5.1.2(ii)"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>292</span><span>293</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>308</span><span>309</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"definition and finite-model argument compared in supplied OCR; finite cardinal indices restored"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-5.1.1"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 为候选集合；下列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_B,\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B),\\mathfrak A_B,T_{\\mathfrak A,B}\">\\(C_B,\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B),\\mathfrak A_B,T_{\\mathfrak A,B}\\)</span> 的定义对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(B\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span> 给出。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathfrak A,B}\">\\(T_{\\mathfrak A,B}\\)</span> 同时记录环境结构与参数集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_b=\\operatorname{Name}_L(b)\">\\(c_b=\\operatorname{Name}_L(b)\\)</span>；该名字函数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5772a390b9182440\" href=\"?note=5772a390b9182440\" title=\"17-df-language-constants\">17-df-language-constants</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})\">\\(S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(C_B)\">\\(L(C_B)\\)</span> 的语言实例解释，不是原语言的型空间。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\!\\upharpoonright L_0\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\!\\upharpoonright L_0\\)</span> is the canonical reduct from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"f48c896e5c0651df\" href=\"?note=f48c896e5c0651df\" title=\"17-df-reduct\">17-df-reduct</a>, defined for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L_0,L_1)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L_0,L_1)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L_1)\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L_1)\\)</span>. All reduct occurrences below use that language-pair interface.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>For each <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(B\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B)=L(C_B)\">\\(\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B)=L(C_B)\\)</span> is the language with fresh names for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"5772a390b9182440\" href=\"?note=5772a390b9182440\" title=\"17-df-language-constants\">17-df-language-constants</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\\)</span> (canonical expansion naming the carrier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"45c3869fde7fe37f\" href=\"?note=45c3869fde7fe37f\" title=\"17-df-diagram\">17-df-diagram</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak{A})\">\\(\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak{A})\\)</span> (elementary diagram, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"b664bed1223db216\" href=\"?note=b664bed1223db216\" title=\"17-df-elementary-diagram\">17-df-elementary-diagram</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B)}\\)</span> (sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_1\">\\(S_1\\)</span> (complete <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>-types, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Realized}\">\\(\\operatorname{Realized}\\)</span> (realization predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"a41374cf828233e6\" href=\"?note=a41374cf828233e6\" title=\"17-df-type-realization\">17-df-type-realization</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa\">\\(\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\nC_B\n&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{Name}_L(b):b\\in B\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B)&amp;:=L(C_B),\\\\\n\\mathfrak{A}_B\n&amp;:=\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\\!\\upharpoonright \\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B),\\\\\nT_{\\mathfrak A,B}\n&amp;:=\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak{A})\n\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak{A})\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\n\\land\n\\forall B\\subseteq|\\mathfrak{A}|\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|B|&lt;\\kappa\n\\to\n\\forall p\\in S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})\\;\n\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak{A}_B}(p)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\nC_B\n&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{Name}_L(b):b\\in B\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B)&amp;:=L(C_B),\\\\\n\\mathfrak{A}_B\n&amp;:=\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\\!\\upharpoonright \\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B),\\\\\nT_{\\mathfrak A,B}\n&amp;:=\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak{A})\n\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak{A})\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\n\\land\n\\forall B\\subseteq|\\mathfrak{A}|\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|B|&lt;\\kappa\n\\to\n\\forall p\\in S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})\\;\n\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak{A}_B}(p)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The index may be any cardinal, including a finite cardinal. This agrees with the definition in §5.1, printed p.292, DjVu page 308, and Proposition 5.1.2(ii), printed p.293, DjVu page 309: every finite structure is saturated at every cardinal index.</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathfrak A,B}\">\\(T_{\\mathfrak A,B}\\)</span> is the complete theory of the expansion of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> by constants for\nthe elements of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>.  Thus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})\">\\(S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})\\)</span> is the space of complete <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>-types over\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>, and saturation requires each such type to be realized inside\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> whenever <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|B|&lt;\\kappa\">\\(|B|&lt;\\kappa\\)</span>.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-reduct","status":"resolved","id":"f48c896e5c0651df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-reduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type-realization","status":"resolved","id":"a41374cf828233e6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-type-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-constants","status":"resolved","id":"5772a390b9182440","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-language-constants]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"45c3869fde7fe37f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-diagram]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"b664bed1223db216","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-diagram]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-constants","status":"resolved","id":"5772a390b9182440","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$。$T_{\\mathfrak A,B}$ 同时记录环境结构与参数集，$c_b=\\operatorname{Name}_L(b)$；该名字函数见 [[17-df-language-constants]]。$S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})$ 按 $L(C_B)$ 的语言实例解释，不是原语言的型空间。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-reduct","status":"resolved","id":"f48c896e5c0651df","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak B\\!\\upharpoonright L_0$ is the canonical reduct from [[17-df-reduct]], defined for $\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L_0,L_1)$ and $\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L_1)$. All reduct occurrences below use that language-pair interface.","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}$ ($L$-structure, see [[17-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-constants","status":"resolved","id":"5772a390b9182440","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"For each $B\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|$, $\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B)=L(C_B)$ is the language with fresh names for $B$, as in [[17-df-language-constants]].","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"45c3869fde7fe37f","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}$ (canonical expansion naming the carrier, see [[17-df-diagram]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-diagram","status":"resolved","id":"b664bed1223db216","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak{A})$ (elementary diagram, see [[17-df-elementary-diagram]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-17","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B)}$ (sentences, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-18","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S_1$ (complete $1$-types, see [[17-df-type]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type-realization","status":"resolved","id":"a41374cf828233e6","anchor":"ref-19","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Realized}$ (realization predicate, see [[17-df-type-realization]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"C_B,\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B),\\mathfrak A_B,T_{\\mathfrak A,B}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"T_{\\mathfrak A,B}","display":false},{"tex":"c_b=\\operatorname{Name}_L(b)","display":false},{"tex":"S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})","display":false},{"tex":"L(C_B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B\\!\\upharpoonright L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L_0,L_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L_1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B)=L(C_B)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak{A})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B)}","display":false},{"tex":"S_1","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Realized}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\nC_B\n&:=\\{\\operatorname{Name}_L(b):b\\in B\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B)&:=L(C_B),\\\\\n\\mathfrak{A}_B\n&:=\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\\!\\upharpoonright \\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B),\\\\\nT_{\\mathfrak A,B}\n&:=\\operatorname{ElemDiag}(\\mathfrak{A})\n\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\operatorname{ParamLang}_L(B)},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa(\\mathfrak{A})\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\n\\land\n\\forall B\\subseteq|\\mathfrak{A}|\\;\n\\Bigl(\n|B|<\\kappa\n\\to\n\\forall p\\in S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})\\;\n\\operatorname{Realized}_{\\mathfrak{A}_B}(p)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T_{\\mathfrak A,B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}","display":false},{"tex":"|B|<\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":3639,"backlinks":[{"id":"0626faf5263e31f8","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$T_{\\mathfrak A,B}$ (complete theory over a parameter set $B$, see [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]])"},{"id":"6dababec25b1b858","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa$ ($\\kappa$-saturation predicate, see [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]])"},{"id":"c5a802b85ee03d3e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa$ ($\\kappa$-saturation predicate, see [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]])"},{"id":"52d57a7b48217ecb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$\\kappa$ 为候选基数；$\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa$ 的定义域包含有限基数，见 [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]。"},{"id":"8a4d6bb923655efc","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\lambda$ is from [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]], and $\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\beta)$ is from [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]."},{"id":"e6a4ebf476ad2f6d","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T_{\\mathfrak A,B}$ (complete theory over parameters $B$, see [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]])"},{"id":"a2084db1d8bf7af0","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$、$\\operatorname{Saturated}_{\\aleph_1}$ 见 [[17-df-model]]、[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]。"},{"id":"c8c9b6ed48fe2f37","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\mathfrak C\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 且 $\\operatorname{Saturated}_{\\aleph_1}(\\mathfrak C)$，见 [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]。\n全载体加名采用 [[17-df-language-constants]]、[[17-df-diagram]] 的 $L(\\mathfrak C)$ 与规范扩张；$T_C,F_C$ 在下式定义。\n$\\operatorname{ElemDiag}$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-diagram]]，$\\mathrm{Form}_{L(\\mathfrak C),1}$、$S_1(T_C)$ 按加名语言实例取 [[17-df-type]] 的接口。\n$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\varphi\\in F_C$；$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]。\n$\\operatorname{Residual}_{\\mathfrak C}$、$\\operatorname{Ext}_{\\mathfrak C}$、$\\operatorname{Rank}_{\\mathfrak C}$ 按 $\\alpha$ 超限递归；$\\operatorname{RM}_{\\mathfrak C}$ 定义域为 $F_C$。\n本接口的 $-1,\\infty$ 是下式编码的两个非序数标记，不在此处进行整数运算或扩展实数运算。"},{"id":"41b33a3963b5c68a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，载体记作 $A=|\\mathfrak A|$，见 [[17-df-structure]]。$\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa$ 取 [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]] 的含有限基数版本；$\\mathrm{Finite}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ 取所列集合论依赖。"},{"id":"1b766f832d5a44a3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kappa$ ($\\kappa$-saturation predicate, see [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]])"},{"id":"76151855abd85b5f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\lambda$ (saturation predicate, see [[17-df-cardinal-saturation]])"},{"id":"3a83277d3d1f3b48","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Saturated}_\\kap